VALUES ('b10bf01d-33f1-47de-a407-8ba33edaa715', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000400', 'Part I: Choose the correct answer from the given alternatives 1. Which of the following regions was incorporated during the first phase of Menilek’s territorial expansion? A. Arsi B. HaraC. Hararghe D. All of the above 2.The last ruler of the kingdom of Wolaita was A. Abba Jifar II B. Gaki Sherocho C. Sheikh Khojale D. Kawo Tona 3.Which of the following was the last territory incorporated into the Ethiopian Empire? A. JimmaB. Konso C. Sidamo D. Gambella 4. The process of unification of the northern and central parts of Ethiopia commenced during the reign of A. Menilek II B. Tewodros II C.Yohanes IV D. Lij Iyyasu History Grade 10 Student Textbook', 'G10-History-STB-2023-web.pdf p.1', '2026.1', 'published', '[0.0024761031,0.026613493,0.0076479474,-0.005803804,-0.01081813,-0.029827282,0.0021240157,-0.008721249,-0.0054357625,-0.14330512,-0.04052317,-0.0014683909,0.06810332,-0.010601751,-0.049044956,-0.045385074,0.017317006,-0.00048000886,0.01656326,-0.0059974403,0.001496801,-0.016369767,0.022256806,-0.00010740115,-0.075378306,-0.019949272,-0.005395177,-0.042269673,0.0012655773,0.18316077,-0.024950957,-0.031242115,-0.019807076,-0.007847364,-0.003038374,-0.013827619,0.00046521376,0.004148041,0.032259233,0.010813306,0.0077128704,-0.03441178,-0.020732168,0.022993723,-0.007336981,-0.013754386,-0.04826312,0.0153619815,0.011976264,-0.011233604,-0.0073940223,-0.0019672147,0.017534716,-0.05518658,0.010762686,0.03672786,0.011175148,-0.012674072,0.031808197,0.04025247,-0.012186878,0.012262175,-0.0035326383,0.024343548,-0.022458116,-0.017141527,0.025934631,-0.049271055,0.046286102,-0.003276743,0.05506128,0.011911697,0.01994592,0.013293955,-0.025169685,0.0077644344,-0.061195508,0.0055953497,0.048041355,0.02543433,0.0067480523,0.0060879816,-0.022746831,0.028777018,-0.0078395065,-0.012093977,-0.0024233123,-0.016395804,-0.010522515,0.033919387,0.006177159,0.008182113,-0.016656527,-0.046997797,-0.00