VALUES ('6fb5b19c-1f5b-462c-8e84-2880b624ea1b', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000400', 'The war hastened the process of decolonization in Asia and Africa. Following the end of the war, the USA and USSR became super-powers of the world. The bloodless diplomatic and political competition and conflict between the two powers and their respective allies known as the Cold War-was another outcome of WWII. The urge for the formation of a new international organization for the maintenance of world peace and order gave birth to the United Nations Organization(UNO), which replaced the League of Nations.', 'G10-History-STB-2023-web.pdf p.1', '2026.1', 'published', '[-0.023113763,0.06856926,-0.023628224,-0.0034384048,0.016889906,-0.019819068,-0.015296627,-0.00035636156,-0.020231467,-0.10610155,-0.050038807,0.037441596,0.04465703,0.011351326,-0.0036590556,-0.041180074,0.03885828,-0.014687689,0.0098303575,0.004476131,0.037511323,0.0111809345,0.039552554,0.003921778,-0.0077542462,0.009844071,-0.03618611,-0.030719953,-0.031147378,0.19074449,0.0046450635,-0.034509387,-0.026700534,0.0215098,-0.044938896,-0.020600228,0.006106535,-0.041788477,0.000819367,-0.027340194,0.03679161,0.008898904,0.0010835454,0.024148654,-0.0026804793,-0.0206782,-0.046378657,0.005030449,0.008697716,-0.0035083545,0.028229568,0.02251706,-0.018901365,-0.03152008,0.008378286,0.042259913,-0.02002228,-0.005300759,0.019145695,0.011066727,0.009001552,0.042526394,0.008737434,-0.0024240129,-0.010602442,-0.04014343,-0.0032502743,-0.07720725,-0.02313113,0.026563236,0.02353921,-0.014797112,0.013575827,0.022250477,-0.022978418,0.0036265075,-0.03085888,0.030685214,0.062799916,0.04732183,-0.0062519526,0.019967973,0.0018985154,0.0018461926,0.006571807,0.031138098,0.0037665546,0.022793489,-0.01945903,0.001960209,-0.02878309,-0.0014855228,0.027571628,-0.056774747,0.018093644,-0.037831437,-0.011499749,-0.018682912,-0.03409264,-0.030965842,-0.010360854,-0.048031952,0.01879566,0.046757534,0.01112095,0.012148591,-0.000090944945,0.0